# ==============================================================================
# Upstream repos consulted during scoping (local clones, never tracked)
# ==============================================================================
# The TOP-LEVEL reference/ only. It holds clones of other projects' code
# (pymdp, PGMax, ...) that docs/scoping-review.md surveyed; nothing in this
# repo imports from it. It is unrelated to src/hybrid_aif/reference/ — the
# package's second tier of declared reference models, environments and
# fixtures.

/reference/

# Claude Code worktrees
.claude/worktrees/

# ==============================================================================
# Run artifacts (P1' chunk 2d)
# ==============================================================================
# `hybrid_aif.reference.raif.run --out runs/...` writes scores.jsonl, metrics.jsonl
# and multi-hundred-MB equinox checkpoints here. The *numbers* land in
# docs/design/amortization-p0-addendum.md §7; the run directory itself is
# reproducible output and is never tracked. Anchored to the repo root, so a
# `runs/` inside some future package would have to opt out on its own.

/runs/
